WEBVTT

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:17.190
Capisce!

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.390
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:20.940
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.190
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:27.720
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.140
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.700
I can't believe this!

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:38.970
Get dance! Come to PriPara today, and

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:12.900
Pushu... pushu... pushu...

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.570
Pushu!

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:20.820
Since she begged me, I let
Cosmo-san look after Jululu, but...

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:25.800
Just watch: I'll cosmically raise her up into the goddess Jewlie!

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:31.040
Onee-sama and I will take great care of her!

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.540
Pushu... pushu...

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.760
But Sophie's totally become like a baby herself.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.600
Get it together, Sophie.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:40.960
Sophie's regressed to a state of infancy;

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.960
she's gone for wool and come home shorn.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:44.660
Lady Sophie!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.200
Leave the babysitting to us-chanko!

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:47.820
Yeah!

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:50.440
Pushu?

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.690
Oh, man, she's crying.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.400
Should we get her some peach juice?

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:57.020
I'm back!

00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:00.410
I've just been to Pakachan Honpo and I've got all the peach juice you could ever want!

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:05.800
Fresh from the orchards of Yapanashi, Pukushima, Napano, Pakayama, Yapagata, Opayama –

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.640
whatever your little heart desires!

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:11.480
Viva pampering! Viva helicopter parenting!

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.410
Cosmo-san, you can't just give her whatever she wants!

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:16.940
Do you want to raise another jellyfish girl?

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.280
Pushu...

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:25.280
How goes the investigation into Jewlie?

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.010
We're still looking into the matter at HQ, but no results as of yet.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.170
I see...

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:35.260
The question remains, why did Jewlie appear in the form of an infant?

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.440
It'ch a puzzling matter indeed.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.400
Ichn't it?

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:44.210
Say, you don't think – could there a matter concealed in a prior Divine Idol Grand Prix?

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.560
Prior Divine Idol Grand Prix?

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:51.440
Indeed. Perhaps something occurred then that transformed Jewlie into her current state.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:55.780
An excellent point. I'll look further into the possibility.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:04:01.130
And once again, <i>ensure</i> word of this matter does not leak.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.410
If you do not stay true to this...

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.250
You'll be getting the horn!

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:08.820
Further to that matter...

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:15.320
The time of Parajuku's first Divine Idol Grand Prix event, where the Divine Hair Accessory is freed, approaches.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:18.200
I presume I can entrust this to you?

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.500
Most certainly.

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:26.170
Will Jululu be all right if we leave her with them?

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:28.900
As long as Cosmo-san doesn't go overboard.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:29.760
Indeed.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:34.140
It's cosmic bathtime!

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.450
How's the galactic Jacuzzi?

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:40.100
She thinks it's out of this world.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.130
Hm?

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:44.480
It's the agency calling.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:45.680
Good evening.

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:49.200
What's that? Oh, okay. Sure.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.490
I'll come right over.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:53.660
What's happening, Onee-sama?

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.930
Something came up at work.

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.120
I'll be back in a cosmic flash once I'm done.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.570
Can I leave Jululu with you in the meantime?

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:01.740
Sure.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.490
I'll look after her.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.030
Isn't that right, Jululu?

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:11.380
Hm?

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.570
Are you okay, Jululu?

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.300
I wonder if the bath wasn't hot enough.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.500
Oh, I know!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.090
Do you want some peach juice?

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.360
It's nice and sweet.

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:34.080
You don't want any?

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:37.850
Kuma-san!

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:40.570
Hey Sophie, when can you be here for the concert?

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:42.830
Kuma-san, it's awful!

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:45.320
I think Jululu's caught a cold.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.720
Say what-kuma? She has a cold?

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:51.260
Little Jululu has a cold? I'll make some rice porridge straight away!

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:55.460
A spring onion in the ear's beary good for colds, right? I can become Jewlie in her place!

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.160
I'll take her to the hospital.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.130
The hospital?

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:00.380
Paws for a moment.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.420
Jululu used to have Jewlie's body, you know.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.340
She's kind of like Falulu and Garuru-kuma.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.800
They won't be able to take bear of her in one of your hospitals.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.020
Like... Falulu and Garuru...

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:14.520
Say, maybe...

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:15.370
Ga–

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:19.570
G–G–G–Garuru!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.820
Then maybe Jululu...

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.080
Try this.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:39.320
Peach juice <i>and</i> Red Flash...

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:43.210
Peach, you say? That reminds me, on today's Good Morning Parajuku news...

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.500
They were talking about the development

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.180
of an amazing peach with oodles of nutrition that gives you peachin' skin.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.010
Miracle Peach?

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.940
That reminds me...

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:56.840
I'm sure I remember reading in a fan letter...

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.440
Dear Lady Sophie.

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:01.410
I'm a huge fan of yours.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.730
Here at our marvellous orchard,

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:08.560
we grow the Miracle Peach, Yapanashi's amazing local specialty.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.860
Please come and try it.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.580
This is it!

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:15.600
In any case, you should return Jululu to the Rosette Pact.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:19.380
There she'll be safe and calm-kuma.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.020
Good idea.

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:26.120
Let's go on inside the Rosette.

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:28.740
There we go.

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:33.220
It looks painful.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:37.010
I hope she gets better when she eats the Miracle Peach.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:42.000
I remember when I was young and had a weak constitution,

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.020
my father went in search of the Powerful Dried Plum for me.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.600
Sophie!

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:50.320
Behold! I've retrieved the Powerful Dried Plum!

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:52.950
All right!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:57.890
Excuse me...

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.180
Eh?

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:01.890
Do you know the way to Yapanashi?

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:04.060
Yapanashi, you say?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:04.980
That's right.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:08.690
I think it's that way.

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:10.380
Thank you very much.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.470
Is this the way...

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:16.720
Pushu...

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.200
I want to go...

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.390
Pushu, pushu...

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:20.440
I want...

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:24.690
Is this Yapanashi?

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:30.040
Excuse me, can you tell me how to get to...

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:32.290
Come on, folks! Next up is Yapagata!

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:38.220
Yapagata was great! On to Panagasa!

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:40.200
Pushu...

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:42.960
Are you all right, Jululu?

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.810
We're at Yapanashi, Jululu.

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:49.880
Just a little while until we find the Miracle Peach.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.240
All right!

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.680
Jululu and Sophie are missing?

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.370
What on earth happened?

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.640
This note was left behind.

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:06.460
"Jululu has a cold, so I'm going to Yapanashi to look for the Miracle Peach. Love, Sophie."

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.610
Wha– "Miracle Peach"?

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:11.600
Jululu... hold on...

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.070
Pushu...

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.030
Pushushu...

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:24.250
How are you feeling, Jululu?

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.550
There we go. Good girl.

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:43.180
I won't... give up.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:46.280
I'll find the Miracle Peach, for sure.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.840
Jululu caught a cold?

00:09:48.890 --> 00:09:51.020
Did she not get enough egg balls?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.630
I'm so cosmically worried!

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.350
What should we do, Minami?

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:59.630
Get it together! You're Jululu's mother, aren't you?

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:02.090
Yeah.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.960
Going from what Kuma said, Sophie must have taken Jululu

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:09.280
and gone to that marvellous orchard to look for the Miracle Peach.

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:11.530
In order to cure Jululu's cold.

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:12.220
And also...

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:13.480
And also?

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:17.760
There's a possibility it could turn her back into Jewlie.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:23.130
For now, we'll have to search every peach orchard she might have gone to.

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:23.740
Yeah!

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:28.320
According to intelligence gathered by Agent 880 of the Yapanashi Branch,

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:34.020
the daughter of an orchard growing the Miracle Peach has sent Lady Sophie a fan letter.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:37.020
So she's gone to Yapanashi?

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:41.560
Yapanashi, you say-chanko? But the according to the report from Yapagata...

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:47.040
Agent 165 reporting from the Yapagata Branch. Lady Sophie has been sighted upstream of Pogami River!

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:52.460
Agent 975 reporting from the Yapagata Branch.
Lady Sophie has been glimpsed at Yapa Temple!

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:56.420
Multiple other intelligence reports are coming in from Yapagata-chanko.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:58.990
Could Lady Sophie...

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:01.860
have possibly confused...

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.600
Yapanashi with Yapagata?

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:13.660
Just a bit longer until we reach Yapanashi...

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.440
Jululu looks like she's in pain.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:20.180
I have to find it quickly...

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.610
Pushu...

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.920
No!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:26.660
I can't give up here. I have to keep going.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:29.820
I have to find the Miracle Peach...

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:34.940
There it is!

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.140
I did it!

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:40.930
I hope there's a whole a bunch...

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:43.650
Hm?

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:52.020
Go for gold!
Miss Universe Cow Grand Prix

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:57.460
Go forth, Miracle Momo, fortuitous pink cow born to this ranch!

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:00.430
Go and bring me back the grand prize!

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:08.660
Ebearyone, I've got to the bottom of it!

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:12.240
I've just confirmed with the staff of Good Morning Parajuku News!

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:12.870
Mm-hm.

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:16.340
The marvellous orchard where the Miracle Peach is grown...

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:17.290
Where is it?

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.060
Yapagata Branch reporting in!

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:23.500
Lady Sophie and a cow were just shipped off from Yapagata Airport as cargo!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:28.050
We're flying off into the cosmos!

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:32.040
Did Sophie travel so far by herself?

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.940
We have to go after her!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.200
We're in Prifornia!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:57.950
I've received a report from the fan club's Prifornia Branch that Sophie's been sighted.

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:01.090
Sophie really came all the way to Prifornia.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.430
Let's go after her!

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:03.780
Yeah!

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:07.040
Ladies and gentlemen an ol' cowboys!

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.060
The winner of Miss Universe Cow contest is...

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:18.100
Miss Japan, Miracle Momo!

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:25.990
Yapanashi sure is a lively place.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:28.430
There's Sophie!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.930
This isn't Yapanashi?

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.870
You're not even in the right continent.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.870
Sophie, I was cosmically worried about you.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:42.250
I wanted to find the Miracle Peach to give to Jululu.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.960
I hoped she would feel better...

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:48.160
Pushu...

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.320
Sophie!

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.200
Fi... fi...

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:58.600
Is Jululu trying to say "Sophie"?

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.070
Fi... fi...

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.280
I think she is.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:09.860
You understood how hard Sophie was trying for you.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:13.450
All right! From here on out,

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:17.040
we'll find that Miracle Peach and cure Jululu's cold!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.720
That's cosmically capisce!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.100
Off we go!

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:21.820
Pushu...

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:25.220
Look, someone's collapsed over there!

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:30.260
I am... invincible...

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:32.060
Father?

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.430
That hit the spot!

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.870
I'm revitalised thanks to you guys!

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.900
I wasn't expecting to find Sophie's father way out here.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:46.440
I was on my way back from questing after the Powerful Dried Plum.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.860
'Twas more perilous than ever.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:51.820
To think I would run dry just outside my own orchard.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:55.440
Were you searching for the Powerful Dried Plum to help me, Father?

00:14:55.440 --> 00:15:00.580
If it's for my adorable daughter's sake, trekking to the ends of the earth is but a walk in the park.

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:05.200
Just like you came all the way to Prifornia to help Jululu.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:11.310
But I didn't end up finding the Miracle Peach at all...

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:16.990
Pea-ch! Pea-ch!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:19.480
Hey...

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.810
There are peaches growing here.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.660
All these trees are covered in them!

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:27.650
Yep, this right here is my pretty peach plantation.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:31.560
But I was certain your orchard grew cherries, Father.

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:35.410
That's right – I told you before how I wanted to plant plum trees for Sophie,

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:39.370
but got them all mixed up with cherry trees, didn't I?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:40.830
Yes...

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:43.170
But then a miracle occurred!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:47.640
I was wrong about them being cherry trees, too – in fact they were peach trees!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:49.560
Peach trees, really?

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:52.320
Just how do you operate your orchard?

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:54.340
Pretty haphazardly, as you can tell.

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:57.780
But the peaches I grow are far from ordinary.

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:00.350
They combine the nutritional power of plums and cherries:

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:03.440
the marvellous Super Miracle Delicious Peach!

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:06.330
So the so-called "marvellous orchard"...

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:07.940
Is my very own!

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:12.910
Here you go, Jululu.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.080
Say "ah".

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.040
Let's get that cold cleared up.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.860
And let's hope the Miracle Peach can turn her back to Jewlie.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.360
She's eating it!

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.440
Peach! Peach!

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:35.290
She's looking a lot better!

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:36.980
I <i>feel</i> better seeing it.

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:39.880
Even if there was no second miracle.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:42.260
But the most important thing is that she's healthy!

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:43.560
That's for sure.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.330
I'm so glad.

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.800
Let's head back to Japan!

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:49.610
We're back home!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:50.360
Tokyo International Airport

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.050
Huzzah!

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:51.400
Tokyo International Airport

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.290
Good to be back!

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.460
Tokyo International Airport

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:57.790
And since I've come all this way, I've just gotta go to Parajuku and catch my daughter performing!

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:58.990
Tokyo International Airport

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.530
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.210
Starting the Coord Change.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:18.370
The season's cherry blossom coord has frills aplenty!

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:22.770
The contrast between the lovely sky-blue and deep pink cherry blossom is simply gorgeous!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.570
Miracle Peach Coord!

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:30.690
Lady Sophie!

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.720
You're so cool-chanko!

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:33.940
Sophie!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.460
Go Sophie!

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:45.810
Have you been good, my little caged birds?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.650
Yes!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.630
A shameless lie.

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:54.880
But you know, my little caged birds,

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:58.590
you can't <i>just</i> stay safe, trapped in that cage.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:04.980
There comes a time when you have to throw it all away, gather your courage and step out of the cage.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.350
And with that courage...

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.280
You can bring forth a miracle.

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:14.880
Lady Sophie!

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:08.850
Making Drama, switch on!

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.570
Cherry blossom-chanko!

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:14.160
Dried plums!

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:15.520
The peach family!

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:25.090
Liberation maiden: Journey to the West!

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:30.580
Cyalume Change!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.820
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:06.090
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:13.740
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:17.270
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:38.450
The closet's doors open for you...

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:41.040
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:59.360
Sophie!

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:01.890
You guys!

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:05.280
At last, Sophie's received a Super Cyalume Coord too-kuma!

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:09.680
Indeed. Thank you all!

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:17.380
Everyone, today we witness the birth of the first team to have received Super Cyalume Coords!

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:20.680
They've beaten us to the punch.

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:21.700
Yeah...

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:24.130
Don't fall before you're cut down. We still have a shot.

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:25.450
That's right-usa.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.730
How frustrating!

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:29.260
Ucha-cha!

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:34.450
Niicha's not gonna beat us-ucha! Triangle's gonna be number one-ucha!

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:36.260
Yep, I got it.

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:40.060
We're super perfect, after all. Our legend's just getting started!

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:41.250
Kano-pero!

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:45.490
PriPara will be closing shortly.

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:49.280
We look forward to seeing you again!

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:10.410
I hope you had a wonderful day in PriPara.

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:11.880
Certainly, thank you very much.

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.560
I'm Manaka Non!

00:23:53.560 --> 00:23:54.930
Were you all shocked?

00:23:54.930 --> 00:23:56.770
I'm her manager Usacha-ucha!

00:23:56.770 --> 00:23:59.280
Have you figured out Triangle's secret-ucha?

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:01.890
It's been crazy tough this whole time.

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:04.250
But our plan was magnificent-ucha!

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:06.760
And we're finally ready to reap our rewards!

00:24:06.760 --> 00:24:08.180
Crush Onee-chan!

00:24:08.180 --> 00:24:09.820
Crush Nii-cha-ucha!

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:11.980
Bow down before our invincible little sister power!

00:24:11.980 --> 00:24:12.770
Ucha!

00:24:13.210 --> 00:24:16.490
Next time, <i>Playing Three Roles Alone Is Hard, </i>Non<i>?</i>

00:24:16.490 --> 00:24:19.820
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
